    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Triminals is a traditional turn-based Roguelike that blends squad tactics with deckbuilding mechanics. Assemble a team of three unique characters as they emerge from the void beyond time, returning to their fragmented pasts to confront their enemies and uncover the truth behind time and fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Your Hand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/5aaeb67ec5851d2b4feb1ce07c0cf029.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span>During combat, all characters' decks are shuffled together! Cards are drawn and distributed sequentially to each character's hand slots. Strategically play or reposition cards to manipulate turn order and maximize their effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Branches</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/fe852e1c77aa0bdf74a9383c650f43d2.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=540 /></span>Each character's distinct past creates branching paths, offering unique optional challenges and narrative events that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/db7b9251f36505fa9f43fc2c3180ded5.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span>Expand your deck with new cards while unlocking specialized hand slots for each character\u2014enabling deep customization and evolving strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique characters</strong>, each with 20+ mechanically distinct hand slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ cards</strong> with unique effects and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 enemy factions</strong> and formidable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-game challenges</strong> that test your mastery</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Triminals is a traditional turn-based Roguelike that blends squad tactics with deckbuilding mechanics. Assemble a team of three unique characters as they emerge from the void beyond time, returning to their fragmented pasts to confront their enemies and uncover the truth behind time and fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Your Hand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/5aaeb67ec5851d2b4feb1ce07c0cf029.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span>During combat, all characters' decks are shuffled together! Cards are drawn and distributed sequentially to each character's hand slots. Strategically play or reposition cards to manipulate turn order and maximize their effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Branches</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/fe852e1c77aa0bdf74a9383c650f43d2.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=540 /></span>Each character's distinct past creates branching paths, offering unique optional challenges and narrative events that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689670/extras/db7b9251f36505fa9f43fc2c3180ded5.avif?t=1753091133\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span>Expand your deck with new cards while unlocking specialized hand slots for each character\u2014enabling deep customization and evolving strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique characters</strong>, each with 20+ mechanically distinct hand slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ cards</strong> with unique effects and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 enemy factions</strong> and formidable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-game challenges</strong> that test your mastery</p></li></ul>",
